he island and definitely will get in a series of troubles to find what happened to the Lost Colony.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1269500/extras/b8196482e0f75fc5f56fc3199b7a2ade.avif?t=1794848315\" width=600 height=66 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>CLASSIC POINT AND CLICK MECHANICS</strong></h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1269500/extras/7a233837e6915882de266e65b7005952.poster.avif?t=1794848315\" width=600 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1269500/extras/7a233837e6915882de266e65b7005952.webm?t=1794848315\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1269500/extras/7a233837e6915882de266e65b7005952.mp4?t=1794848315\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Collect, combine, and use items to solve puzzles.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>PIRATES ARE HERE TOO!</strong></h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1269500/extras/b5d350f581fa3a46a5a10884fbc1251c.poster.avif?t=1794848315\" width=600 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1269500/extras/b5d350f581fa3a46a5a10884fbc1251c.webm?t=1794848315\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1269500/extras/b5d350f581fa3a46a5a10884fbc1251c.mp4?t=1794848315\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Try to deal with routine pirate visitors of Crowalt and of course, enjoy funny dialogues.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FOLLOW YOUR JOURNAL</strong></h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline po